{"name":"卡片","description":"卡片是把同一对象的标题、摘要、图片和操作组织在一起的内容容器 · 项目、商品或文章的浏览页可一张卡片对应一个对象。整张卡是否能点击必须清楚；局部操作则让链接和按钮分别承担。","quote":"每个商品做成一张小卡片：图在上面，名字价格在下，整张都能点。","agentPrompt":"把模板市场的每个模板做成独立卡片，展示封面、名称、作者和价格，点击主区域进入对应详情。请避免嵌套卡片，并验证卡片内按钮不会误触详情跳转。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-card\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>卡片<span>Card</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">每个商品做成一张小卡片：图在上面，名字价格在下，整张都能点。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">卡片是把同一对象的标题、摘要、图片和操作组织在一起的内容容器</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>项目、商品或文章的浏览页可一张卡片对应一个对象。整张卡是否能点击必须清楚；局部操作则让链接和按钮分别承担。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"card-d\">\n    <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-workspace.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cd-body\">\n      <div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴：零基础组件入门</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂一个。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">详情</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即学习</button></div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>把模板市场的每个模板做成独立卡片，展示封面、名称、作者和价格，点击主区域进入对应详情。请避免嵌套卡片，并验证卡片内按钮不会误触详情跳转。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>内容推荐流</b>：文章卡、视频卡、商品卡</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:8px\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:124px;width:auto;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;border-radius:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#722ed1)\"></i><span style=\"padding:7px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">无线耳机</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">¥ 299</span></span></div><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:124px;width:auto;padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:36px;border-radius:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#287947,#14c9c9)\"></i><span style=\"padding:7px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px\"><b style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">机械键盘</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600\">¥ 199</span></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>仪表盘</b>上每个指标一块卡，方便扫读</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:128px;width:auto;gap:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">销售额</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3\">¥ 86.4w</span></div><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:128px;width:auto;gap:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">订单数</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3\">12,846</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把长页面<b>切成几个内容分组</b>，比如设置页</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">通知设置</span><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">邮件通知</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-switch on\"><i></i></span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">短信通知</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-switch\"><i></i></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>图片占比大</b>的内容，封面放卡片顶部</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"padding:0;overflow:hidden;width:160px;max-width:100%\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:38px;border-radius:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#722ed1)\"></i><span style=\"padding:7px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:56%\"></i></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>纯文字长文</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/typography?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"typography\" aria-label=\"排版 Typography\">排版 <b>Typography</b></a> 组织排版</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">年度总结报告</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">长文已经自成内容区，额外卡片边界会干扰阅读</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>卡片内再嵌套卡片</b>，双层边框会让容器边界相互竞争</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"gap:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">外层卡片</span><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">内层卡片</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">每条只有一行文字：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/list?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"list\" aria-label=\"列表 List\">列表 <b>List</b></a> 更紧凑</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">账号与安全</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">消息通知</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">隐私设置</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">整页只有<b>一块独立内容</b>，通常不需要再套卡片边界</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">整页唯一的内容也要套个框</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:270px\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cover\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-workspace.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div></span>\n      <div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"title\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴入门</div></span>\n        <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"text\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-text\">每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂一个。</div></span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"actions\" style=\"display:block\"><div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">详情</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">立即学习</button></div></span>\n    </div></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">卡片</span><span class=\"pe\">Card</span></button><span class=\"pd\">内容容器，一块 = 一个整体</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"cover\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">封面</span><span class=\"pe\">Cover</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可选，图片放顶部最抓眼</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"title\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">标题</span><span class=\"pe\">Title</span></button><span class=\"pd\">卡片里最重的一行字</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"text\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">正文</span><span class=\"pe\">Content</span></button><span class=\"pd\">摘要、说明等补充信息</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"actions\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">操作区</span><span class=\"pe\">Actions</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可选，放和这张卡相关的按钮</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">基础卡片<span>Basic</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">团队知识库</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">收录 47 篇文档，每周更新。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">一组文字信息需要作为完整对象浏览时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带封面<span>With Cover</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-mountain.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴入门</div></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">图片是主要识别信息时，将封面置于卡片顶部</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">简洁无边框<span>Flat</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"card-d flat\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">快捷入口</div>\n      <div class=\"cd-text\">弱化边框，融进背景。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">页面背景已清楚划分内容区域时，可弱化卡片边框</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带操作<span>With Actions</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:180px\">\n      <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">官网改版 v2</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cd-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">预览</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">编辑</button></div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">用户要在卡片上直接预览或编辑</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">内容推荐流</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:52px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-mountain.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">AI 图鉴入门</div><div class=\"cd-text\">每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂。</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:52px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/cover-workspace.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">我的桌面布置</div><div class=\"cd-text\">整理常用设备与收纳方式。</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:52px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-summer.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">夏日城市漫游</div><div class=\"cd-text\">周末两小时的拍照路线。</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">仪表盘指标卡</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\"><div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <div class=\"cd-text\" style=\"margin-top:0\">本月销售额</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">¥ 86.4w</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">↑ 12.5%</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\"><div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <div class=\"cd-text\" style=\"margin-top:0\">订单数</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">12,846</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">↑ 8.3%</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\"><div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <div class=\"cd-text\" style=\"margin-top:0\">退款率</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">2.1%</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">↓ 0.4%</div></div></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">设置页分组</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:100%\"><div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <div class=\"cd-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:6px\">通知设置</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 0\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);flex:1\">邮件通知</span><label class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:36px;height:20px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 0\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);flex:1\">短信通知</span><label class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:36px;height:20px\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"width:100%\"><div class=\"cd-body\">\n        <div class=\"cd-title\">隐私设置</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 0\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);flex:1\">公开我的主页</span><label class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:36px;height:20px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n      </div></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">商品展示</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:56px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-city.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">无线耳机 Pro</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);flex:1\">¥ 299</span><span class=\"demo-tag red\">限时 8 折</span></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-d\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto;min-width:0\">\n        <div class=\"cd-cover\" style=\"height:56px;background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/photo-cat.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></div>\n        <div class=\"cd-body\"><div class=\"cd-title\">猫爪机械键盘</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-top:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);flex:1\">¥ 199</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">新品</span></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/cards-component/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">卡片：UI 组件的定义</span><span class=\"reference-source\">NN/g ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/cards/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Cards 卡片</span><span class=\"reference-source\">Material Design ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/card","markdown":"# 卡片Card\n\n你可能会说\n每个商品做成一张小卡片：图在上面，名字价格在下，整张都能点。\n\n**卡片是把同一对象的标题、摘要、图片和操作组织在一起的内容容器**·项目、商品或文章的浏览页可一张卡片对应一个对象。整张卡是否能点击必须清楚；局部操作则让链接和按钮分别承担。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 把模板市场的每个模板做成独立卡片，展示封面、名称、作者和价格，点击主区域进入对应详情。请避免嵌套卡片，并验证卡片内按钮不会误触详情跳转。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **内容推荐流**：文章卡、视频卡、商品卡\n\n**无线耳机**¥ 299\n\n**机械键盘**¥ 199\n- **仪表盘**上每个指标一块卡，方便扫读\n\n销售额¥ 86.4w\n\n订单数12,846\n- 把长页面**切成几个内容分组**，比如设置页\n\n通知设置\n邮件通知\n\n短信通知\n- **图片占比大**的内容，封面放卡片顶部\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- **纯文字长文**：使用 [排版 **Typography**](/vibe-hub/typography?lang=zh) 组织排版\n\n年度总结报告长文已经自成内容区，额外卡片边界会干扰阅读\n- **卡片内再嵌套卡片**，双层边框会让容器边界相互竞争\n\n外层卡片\n内层卡片\n- 每条只有一行文字：使用 [列表 **List**](/vibe-hub/list?lang=zh) 更紧凑\n\n账号与安全›\n\n消息通知›\n\n隐私设置›\n- 整页只有**一块独立内容**，通常不需要再套卡片边界\n\n整页唯一的内容也要套个框\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\nAI 图鉴入门\n\n        \n每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂一个。\n\n      \n详情立即学习\n\n1卡片Card内容容器，一块 = 一个整体\n\n2封面Cover可选，图片放顶部最抓眼\n\n3标题Title卡片里最重的一行字\n\n4正文Content摘要、说明等补充信息\n\n5操作区Actions可选，放和这张卡相关的按钮\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n基础卡片Basic\n\n团队知识库\n\n      \n收录 47 篇文档，每周更新。\n\n一组文字信息需要作为完整对象浏览时\n\n带封面With Cover\n\nAI 图鉴入门\n\n图片是主要识别信息时，将封面置于卡片顶部\n\n简洁无边框Flat\n\n快捷入口\n\n      \n弱化边框，融进背景。\n\n页面背景已清楚划分内容区域时，可弱化卡片边框\n\n带操作With Actions\n\n官网改版 v2\n\n      \n预览编辑\n\n用户要在卡片上直接预览或编辑\n\n典型使用场景\n\n内容推荐流\n\nAI 图鉴入门\n\n每个组件一张卡片，3 分钟看懂。\n\n      \n我的桌面布置\n\n整理常用设备与收纳方式。\n\n      \n夏日城市漫游\n\n周末两小时的拍照路线。\n\n仪表盘指标卡\n\n本月销售额\n\n        \n¥ 86.4w\n\n        \n↑ 12.5%\n\n      \n订单数\n\n        \n12,846\n\n        \n↑ 8.3%\n\n      \n退款率\n\n        \n2.1%\n\n        \n↓ 0.4%\n\n设置页分组\n\n通知设置\n\n        \n邮件通知\n\n        \n短信通知\n\n      \n隐私设置\n\n        \n公开我的主页\n\n商品展示\n\n无线耳机 Pro\n\n          \n¥ 299限时 8 折\n\n      \n猫爪机械键盘\n\n          \n¥ 199新品\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[卡片：UI 组件的定义NN/g ↗](https://www.nngroup.com/articles/cards-component/)[Cards 卡片Material Design ↗](https://m3.material.io/components/cards/overview)"}